  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Sheet pan salmon turns dinner into an easy win, with flaky salmon glazed in maple syrup, Dijon mustard, and bright lemon. Roasted on a colorful bed of asparagus, cherry tomatoes, and sweet bell peppers, everything cooks together until the fish is tender and the veggies are caramelized and crisp tender. A sprinkle of fresh thyme adds a cozy, herby finish that makes each bite taste sunny and satisfying. Ready in about 30 minutes, sheet pan salmon is simple, nourishing, and perfect for busy weeknights or relaxed gatherings.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-sheet-pan-salmon\">Why You’ll Love This Sheet pan salmon</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-sheet-pan-salmon\">How to Make Sheet Pan Salmon</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-sheet-pan-salmon\">Pro Tips for Making Sheet pan salmon</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-sheet-pan-salmon\">How to Serve this Sheet pan salmon</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-sheet-pan-salmon\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This Sheet pan salmon</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Quick and easy prep for busy weeknights.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>One pan means less cleanup and more time to relax.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Packed with nutrients and flavor for a healthy meal.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Versatile recipe to customize with your favorite veggies.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfectly cooked salmon every time, flaky and delicious!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-8874\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"8874\" data-servings=\"4\"><div cla